WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.934
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.534
I'm here with my co-host,
Demi Lovato!

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:06.501
[ Cheers and applause ]
New album out this Friday.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:09.367
It is time to play
"Can You Feel It?"

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:10.501
Eww!

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:15.133
-♪ "Can You Feel It?" ♪

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:16.601
Alright, here's how this works.

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:19.000
We're going to have a number of
mystery objects brought out

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.067
in front of us, and our job
is to guess what is in each one.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:25.267
The catch is that we have to
figure it out by touch alone.

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:26.434
We don't even
see what's in the box.

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:27.534
Are you ready for this?

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:28.634
-No.
-I know. Me neither.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.100
I don't know why
we're playing this again,

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.133
because we've done this,

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.701
and I really can't
stand this game.

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:33.801
But alright.

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:35.968
But, Demi,
since we're co-hosting --

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.367
Oh, I'll start things off?
[ Laughs ]

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:41.567
I thought it was going to say,
since we're co-hosting,

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:42.868
you start it off.

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.434
I guess I'm going to
start it off.

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:46.400
Alright.
Let's get the first object.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.734
Here we go.
♪♪

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:51.567
We're going to have 30 seconds
to identify what this is.

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:52.701
[ Audience "Ohhs" ]

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:53.934
Audience, don't do that,

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:55.634
'cause this is
exactly what happens.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:58.968
They start "oohing" and "aahing"
and "awwing," and -- Oh, gosh.

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:01.033
-Oh, man!

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:02.534
-Alright,
that doesn't help me at all.

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:06.601
Alright, we have 30 seconds --
ugh! -- to identify what it is.

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:09.267
I can't even think.
I'm so bummed out right now.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:12.400
Alright. Aah!

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.267
Aah!

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:19.567
♪♪

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:21.100
-It's going to get you!

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:26.300
-Aah! Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.667
It was like a wet nose.
Like a wet nose in there.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:32.434
There's a wet nose that,
like, licked me or something.

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:33.701
Gross!

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.234
Aah!

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:36.701
Gosh!

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.067
Alright, it's light.

00:01:38.067 --> 00:01:40.968
It's light, so there's nothing
alive in here -- maybe!

00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:43.601
-Maybe. You don't know.
-Oh, God!

00:01:43.601 --> 00:01:45.501
♪♪

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:46.667
Stop.

00:01:46.667 --> 00:01:49.601
Someone just yelled,
and I'm freaking out!

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:51.968
Aah! Aah!

00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:00.501
I'm really --
I'm seriously freaking out.

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:07.701
Ugh!

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:09.634
[ Buzzer ]
Alright, I'm out.

00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:12.434
What in the -- What is it?

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:14.767
It did move!
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:15.934
-It did move.
-It did move.

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:18.033
-It was moving.
-This thing is ridiculous.

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:19.834
I cannot...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.968
♪♪

00:02:21.968 --> 00:02:23.434
Feel my heartbeat.

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:25.334
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.901
-Alright, Demi, you're up.

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:28.334
Because you're my co-host,
you're very lucky.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:29.400
You get the second one.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.667
-Cool.
-Yeah.

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:33.934
And we up
the craziness on each box.

00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:35.567
Aah!

00:02:35.567 --> 00:02:36.834
-No!

00:02:36.834 --> 00:02:40.667
-Aaaah!
-[ Laughing ] No!

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:41.968
-Aaaaah!

00:02:41.968 --> 00:02:45.334
-No! No!

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:46.934
No! I hate that.

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:48.567
-No, you love it.

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.334
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:52.801
-My heart's beating
really fast now.

00:02:54.267 --> 00:02:56.067
Do I just do one hand or both?
-You can go for it.

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:57.767
-Oh, my God.

00:02:57.767 --> 00:02:59.033
Wait.

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:08.334
It's slimy! I hate it!

00:03:08.334 --> 00:03:11.701
Is there hair? What is this?

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:14.167
Oh, my God!

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:18.100
Is it -- Oh, it's like --
It's Jell-O.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.567
-Wow!
-It's Jell-O.

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:20.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:23.133
[ Dinging ]

00:03:23.133 --> 00:03:25.467
Oh, it's got a troll inside.

00:03:25.467 --> 00:03:27.834
-But how are we -- anyone ever
supposed to guess this?

00:03:27.834 --> 00:03:28.868
A troll inside a Jell-O mold?

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:30.767
-Yeah, I was not
going to get that.

00:03:30.767 --> 00:03:32.734
-Who would ever
guess that thing? Alright.

00:03:32.734 --> 00:03:34.701
I would say you're lucky
you get to go twice,

00:03:34.701 --> 00:03:36.234
but it's my turn now.

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:37.701
Alright, let's bring it in.
Alright.

00:03:37.701 --> 00:03:39.400
Oh, man, I really...

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.601
[ Breathes deeply ]

00:03:41.601 --> 00:03:42.934
Alright.

00:03:42.934 --> 00:03:47.734
-Oh, this is not good.

00:03:47.734 --> 00:03:50.300
This is not good.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.934
I would hate that.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.767
I would hate that.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:00.634
You might want to
roll up your sleeves.

00:04:00.634 --> 00:04:02.667
-Oh, man!

00:04:02.667 --> 00:04:04.033
Don't say that to me.

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:06.434
Gosh!

00:04:09.234 --> 00:04:11.300
-Oh, my God. The way...

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:14.534
[ Laughs ] I know!

00:04:14.534 --> 00:04:22.968
♪♪

00:04:22.968 --> 00:04:24.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:32.501
-Aah! Wait.

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:35.634
So, I almost touched it there?

00:04:35.634 --> 00:04:37.501
-Wait. Wait.
-Everyone started clapping.

00:04:37.501 --> 00:04:40.033
They were, like, freaking out,
because I almost touched it.

00:04:40.033 --> 00:04:41.367
-Right...

00:04:43.868 --> 00:04:45.300
Right...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.801
Closer.

00:04:47.934 --> 00:04:49.067
There you go.

00:04:49.067 --> 00:04:52.167
-Aah! It stung me!
It stung me!

00:04:52.167 --> 00:04:53.567
Something stung me!

00:04:53.567 --> 00:04:56.534
Oh! Oh! Bleeding!

00:04:56.534 --> 00:04:59.534
I'm bleeding!

00:05:00.934 --> 00:05:03.334
What is it?! It's gross!

00:05:03.334 --> 00:05:05.801
I'm bleeding!

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:07.901
Did that move?

00:05:07.901 --> 00:05:11.334
I'm looking at what it...
[ Buzzer ]

00:05:11.334 --> 00:05:13.334
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:05:14.801 --> 00:05:17.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:17.434 --> 00:05:19.701
I can't even...

00:05:19.701 --> 00:05:21.467
It's unbelievable. It moved.

00:05:21.467 --> 00:05:23.601
I can't --
Both of my things moved.

00:05:23.601 --> 00:05:26.901
Your thing did not move.
Demi, lucky you. You're up.

00:05:26.901 --> 00:05:28.200
Maybe you get to go twice.
♪♪

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.467
-Yeah, but it ups
the ante every time?

00:05:29.467 --> 00:05:30.667
-That's right. Yes, we do.

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:33.534
-So I'm not looking forward
to this at all.

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:34.901
[ Audience groans ]

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:37.968
No! Don't do that.

00:05:39.968 --> 00:05:43.334
You can't dance.
That's not fair.

00:05:43.334 --> 00:05:46.167
I didn't dance
when you were up here.

00:05:46.167 --> 00:05:48.934
Okay. Here we go.

00:05:48.934 --> 00:05:50.200
I'm shaking.
-You got this.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.267
-Oh, my God.

00:05:51.267 --> 00:05:52.734
Why is it --
There's heat radiating.

00:05:52.734 --> 00:05:55.434
-No, no. You got this.
-Is it in my head?

00:05:55.434 --> 00:05:57.367
-You got it.

00:05:57.367 --> 00:05:59.567
-Wet!

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:02.467
Oh! Wait.

00:06:02.467 --> 00:06:05.133
Oh, oh, it's water.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.133 --> 00:06:08.734
-It's water with rubber duckies.
-Oh.

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:10.467
[ Dinging ]
-It's unbelievable.

00:06:10.467 --> 00:06:13.367
-That's cute.
-I'm so mad.

00:06:13.367 --> 00:06:15.167
This is why --
This how much more

00:06:15.167 --> 00:06:17.234
my writers love you than me.

00:06:17.234 --> 00:06:18.767
Little rubber duckies in water.

00:06:18.767 --> 00:06:21.167
I got the grossest --
What even was that?

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:23.467
SpaghettiOs
spitting out of a volcano?

00:06:23.467 --> 00:06:25.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.467
Thank goodness
this is the last one.

00:06:27.467 --> 00:06:29.400
We're going to touch the
same item at the same time.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:33.400
We're going to get --
First person to guess it wins.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's never good.

00:06:35.767 --> 00:06:37.901
-No, no.

00:06:37.901 --> 00:06:40.000
[ Both laugh ]

00:06:43.701 --> 00:06:45.601
I'm gonna freak out.
♪♪

00:06:56.767 --> 00:07:00.567
-It's hot. I can feel heat.
-It's hot, right?

00:07:05.567 --> 00:07:08.400
-Oh, no! What is that?
-I don't know! I don't know!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.167
-It's hairy!
-No, it's not!

00:07:10.167 --> 00:07:11.267
No, it's not!
-No, it's hairy!

00:07:11.267 --> 00:07:14.767
-It's hairy?! No!

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:15.901
[ Both scream ]

00:07:15.901 --> 00:07:18.234
-No! Oh, my God!
-What is it?

00:07:18.234 --> 00:07:20.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.968 --> 00:07:23.834
Come here, come here, come here.

00:07:23.834 --> 00:07:25.868
It's Kenan Thompson.

00:07:25.868 --> 00:07:27.567
-Did you not know?

00:07:27.567 --> 00:07:30.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:30.601 --> 00:07:31.934
-I'm freaking out.
I'm so happy it's you.

00:07:31.934 --> 00:07:34.300
-You didn't know?
-I'm so happy it's you.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.400
-I wanted to bite you.
-Kenan Thompson, everybody!

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.033
Oh, my gosh.

00:07:39.033 --> 00:07:40.467
We're talking to Kenan
after the break.

00:07:40.467 --> 00:07:42.133
Stick around, everybody.
Thank you, Demi.

